# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Files excluded pending de-identification review -- see DEIDENT_REVIEW.md.
# The rule: raw questionnaire exports, free-text notes, and anything carrying
# wallclock timestamps (scan date + subject ID is an indirect identifier)
# stay out of history until reviewed. Git history is forever; adding a file
# later is one commit, scrubbing one is a rewrite.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# raw questionnaire exports (health screening, free text)
Data/screener_clean.csv
Data/postscan_clean.csv
Data/run_notes.csv
Data/Data.zip

# derived tables that carry wallclock timestamps
Data/log_sessions.csv
Data/log_runs.csv
Data/log_run_attempts.csv
Data/log_qc_flags.csv
Data/physio_blocks.csv
Data/physio_session_status.csv

# Google Drive sync artefacts
*.driveupload
*.drivedownload
.tmp.drive*
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# R session cruft
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# python cruft
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Atlas sources and built ROI masks: redistribution terms for CAREN not
# established and this repository is public. Scripts/intero2023_build_rois.py
# rebuilds them; ROIs/roi_manifest.csv holds the registered checksums.
Atlas/
ROIs/*.nii
